 ╭─ Keys ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
 │                                                                              │
 │ navigate                                                                     │
 │ j/k ↓/↑    prev/next branch                                                  │
 │ J/K        prev/next branch (from inside)                                    │
 │ gg/G       top/bottom                                                        │
 │ ctrl+d/u   half page                                                         │
 │ .          current branch                                                    │
 │ [ ]        prev/next stack                                                   │
 │                                                                              │
 │ expand                                                                       │
 │ l → enter  one level in, opening it                                          │
 │ h ←        one level out, closing it                                         │
 │ f          files                                                             │
 │ C          commits                                                           │
 │ x          CI checks                                                         │
 │ z / Z      toggle branch / collapse all                                      │
 │                                                                              │
 │ branch or item                                                               │
 │ o          open PR(s) / item in browser                                      │
 │ y          copy name(s) / path / sha / url                                   │
 │ Y          copy changed file paths                                           │
 │ e          edit file in $EDITOR                                              │
 │ c          checkout branch                                                   │
 │ M          merge PR (and below)                                              │
 │ D          toggle PR(s) draft / ready (selection or hovered)                 │
 │ A          ask reviewers (selection or hovered, draft or ready)              │
 │                                                                              │
 │ stack                                                                        │
 │ p          push                                                              │
 │ s          sync                                                              │
 │ P          sync --prune                                                      │
 │ S          submit --auto                                                     │
 │ rr ru rd   rebase all/upstack/downstack                                      │
 │ rc ra      rebase continue/abort                                             │
 │ a          add branch                                                        │
 │ m          modify (interactive)                                              │
 │ u          unstack                                                           │
 │ :          run gh stack …                                                    │
 │                                                                              │
 │ review                                                                       │
 │ space      mark branch                                                       │
 │ v          visual range                                                      │
 │ R          review selection in tuicr (one branch: its PR)                    │
 │                                                                              │
 │ symbols                                                                      │
 │ ● ○        checked out / other branch                                        │
 │ ◆ ◇        selected: checked out / other                                     │
 │ ◎ ✓        in merge queue / merged                                           │
 │ ┊          needs a rebase onto its parent                                    │
 │ ✓ ✗ ●      checks passed / failed / running                                  │
 │ M A D R    file modified / added / deleted / renamed                         │
 │ N bot      unresolved threads started by bots                                │
 │                                                                              │
 │ other                                                                        │
 │ ctrl+r     refresh now                                                       │
 │ !          toggle output                                                     │
 │ esc        clear / close                                                     │
 │ ctrl+c     cancel running op and queue / quit                                │
 │ ?          help                                                              │
 │ q          quit                                                              │
 │                                                                              │
 ╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
  j/k scroll  ctrl+d/u half page  g/G top/end  esc close
